ung C's crash repair closed it.\n- In the revival changes, E's quotation of apis.tex was cited at :252-256; it stands at :250-254.\n- C's range bullet named two tests that do not assert 'r = r is true'. It now says what each test asserts, and the missing test is routed as review-routed.1.\n- One quotation in the PLAN entry for E.skeptic.1 cited the wrong source-code.tex lines.\n\n**4. The specification.** The one sentence a rung listed as made false, Appendix I's Effect sentence in changes.tex:2918-2923, is corrected and matches the code.\n\n**5 and 6. Points and curator items.** All points to report are reversible, so none holds the push. All six curator items are in PLAN.md:562-565 under \"Off the path, parked\". I added two entries of my own:\n- review.1 (PLAN.md:566): walk's stale comment at OverloadedFunction.java:1894-1895.\n- review-routed.1 (PLAN.md:567): a compiled test that a range equals itself is owed."

